 rançois Willème. Employing projection technologies and mechanical instru
 ments\, Willème and his team of operators translated photographic negativ
 es into solid figures across a variety of media\, aiming to create afforda
 bl\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://museum.stanford.edu/exhibitions/soli
